accumulate "/home/jfs/mmt/content/MathHub/MMT/LATIN2/export/lf-elpi/content/latin..NONE/$Simple$Products".

/* generated from exten : {A,B,u,v:tm (simpprod A B)}ded (equal A (simppi1 A B u) (simppi1 A B v))⟶ded (equal B (simppi2 A B u) (simppi2 A B v))⟶ded (equal (simpprod A B) u v) */

ded X3 (equal (simpprod A B) u v) :- help/exten A B u v X1 X2 X3 , ded X1 (equal A (simppi1 A B u) (simppi1 A B v)) , ded X2 (equal B (simppi2 A B u) (simppi2 A B v)).

help/exten A B u v (prodcert X1/1 X1/2) (prodcert X2/1 X2/2) (prodcert X3/1 X3/2) :- help/exten A B u v X1/1 X2/1 X3/1 , help/exten A B u v X1/2 X2/2 X3/2.

help/exten A B u v (idcert X1) (idcert X1) (idcert X2) :- X2 > 0 , X1 is X2 - 1.

help/exten A B u v (ptcert X1) (ptcert X1) (ptcert (exten A B u v X1 X1)).

